[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……というのが、１か月前の出来事なんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So that's what happened a month ago."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……ちなみにその時の監視、\n九偉人ってオチだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... By the way, those people watching you back then? They were part of the Nine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、やっぱりそうだったんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I thought so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結局、あの後もずっと後をつけられてたよね。\n捕まえようとしても逃げられちゃうし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They kept following us after that too. And whenever we tried to get a jump on them, they'd just run away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっはっは！\u3000ま、それがあいつらの役目だ。\nあまり悪く思わないでやってくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha ha ha! Well, that's their job. Don't hold it against them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、そっちは２枚目も見つけたし\n少しは進展があったみたいでよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, you found a second portrait on your end, so at least there was some progress."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちはシトリンたちと一緒に王国中を\n回ったけど成果なしさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We traveled all over the kingdom with Citrine and the others but came up empty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "暗黒の氷海とケイウン……やっぱり\n他の九偉人図も無数島群域にあるんだろうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Midnight Sea and Keiun... The other Portraits of the Nine must be in the Infinite Island Chain too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば……アルビーナ、どうしてるかな。\nしばらく会ってないから心配だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come to think of it... I wonder how Alvina's doing. We haven't seen her in a while, so I'm a little worried."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫。アルビーナなら、きっと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's fine. I'm sure of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当かなあ？\u3000あの子はああ見えて\n結構打たれ弱いところがあると思うけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so? That girl may not look it, but she's pretty fragile when things get rough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはそれは、心配してくれてありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, well. Thanks for worrying about me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "？？？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えと……久しぶり。\nでもまあ、挨拶より先に見せたいものがあってだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... Long time no see. But before we catch up, there's something I want to show you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is this...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ、九偉人図の１枚でしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's one of the Portraits of the Nine, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……間違いない！！\nでも、どうしてアルビーナが！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... No doubt about it! But how did you come by it?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国の外れ、\n試しの洞窟の奥に埋められてたの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was buried deep in the Cave of Trials on the outskirts of Nova."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんであんな所にあったのかは、分からないけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're not sure why it was in a place like that, though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "再挑戦ついでに採取しようと思って\n持っていった探知機が役に立ったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The detector we brought for gathering materials on our retry came in handy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "金属製の箱で厳重に封されてたからね。\n誰かが埋めたのは間違いないと思うけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was sealed tight in a metal box. Someone definitely buried it there on purpose..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国には九偉人の壁画もあったし、\nパルメ族とも関係が深い場所だから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nova does have that mural of the Nine, and it's deeply connected to the Palme..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこに九偉人図があるのは確かに納得だよ。\n灯台下暗しだったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it makes sense that a Portrait of the Nine would be there, right under our noses."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Also..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……この前は無理だなんて弱音吐いてごめん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sorry for giving up before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "死にかけても二人みたいには前を向けないって、\n暗黒の氷海で思い知って、正直まだ怖いけど……でも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After our brush with death, I realized I couldn't press on like the two of you. And honestly, I'm still scared... But!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつか、再挑戦する時までには立ち直りたい！\n怖いから諦めるなんてのも、やっぱりできないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the time we try the Midnight Sea again, I want to have recovered! I can't just give up because I'm afraid."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "厚かましいのは百も承知だけど……あの海ほど\n激しくない場所なら、力になれると思うから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know this is a lot to ask, but... as long as it's not as intense as that sea, I think I can be useful..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシもまた旅に連れてって！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So please take me on your travels again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからも、よろしくね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're counting on you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うおおおおおん！\u3000ありがとう二人とも～！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Waaaaaah! Thank you both so much!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おぉー。一応、立ち上がれたっぽいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, well. Looks like she managed to pick herself back up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "信じて待ち続けたレスナが粋だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna was really chic, waiting for her to come around like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、レスナ。次の行き先ってもう決まってる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, Resna. Have you decided where we're going next?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。ちょうど、鏑矢さんから絵の出所について\n情報提供があったところ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Kaburaya just gave us information about where the painting came from."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウンに九偉人図を贈ったのは、「ブラオール」\nっていう島の資産家なんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apparently the Portrait of the Nine given to Keiun came from a wealthy family on an island called Braulle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ブラオール……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Braulle..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ、知ってる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know of it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん！\n諸島同盟の中でも最大規模を誇る、文化の中心地だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! It's the largest island in the Archipelago Federation and the center of culture!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ～。ランターナでいう王都みたいな場所かなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow. So it's like the capital of Lantarna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "賑やかな旅になりそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sounds like it'll be an eventful trip."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]